in nh3 when you are invisible you know where you are because the cursor
is still located on you unlike the invisible behavior of previous
versions of the game. see invisible, of course, restores your ability
to see the familiar "@" among other things. however, in nh3.0g5+ if
you've eaten a mimic you'll prefer mimicking a treasure chest instead
of a human and so you'll appear as a "$" until you "return to human
form" as the result of a shape change.
